            <ArticleTitle>Respiratory depression complicating epidural diamorphine. Two case reports of administration after dural puncture.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1203-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Two cases of severe respiratory depression complicating epidural diamorphine administration are reported. In both cases, the dura had been punctured. The risk of epidural opiate administration in association with a breach in the dura is reiterated.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
